  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, brown sugar, soy sauce, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add chicken to the marinade and mix well to coat. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes or up to 2 hours.",
    "Thread chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Place skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Brush skewers with remaining marinade.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 20-25 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through and slightly charred.",
    "Let rest for 5 minutes before serving."
